      "url": "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHM1R2Ehu7XZnx6yxnVuEDm4ERseDvD0sg4Hcm0j5t9qSgpDUsjNWP6UGqilD_3dRTDUpDmyF6rTDqIR_j_2lhmQRdoMdCu2mSNCNkrRmXLSQyfW9wB1hzx1D-tcRPPGwQYbaxG9UhFPCXEXzkY0S029VXK5ob48gKeXeufywXfV6k=",
      "publisher": "Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews",
      "published": "2020-04-20",
      "quote": "There is no evidence of an association between MMR immunisation and encephalitis or encephalopathy (rate ratio 0.90, 95% CI 0.50 to 1.61; 2 observational studies; 1,071,088 children; low certainty evidence), and autistic spectrum disorders (rate ratio 0.93, 95% CI 0.85 to 1.01; 2 observational studies; 1,194,764 children; moderate certainty).",
      "role": "contradicts"
